{"key": "data/과제분류하기/인터넷프로그래밍_총괄과졔 김신욱(2200614).html", "text": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n\n<html>\n<head>\n\t<title> 총괄과제(특수문자) </title>\n\t<style>\n\t\tpre.prob {\n\t\t\tbackground-color : black;\n\t\t\tfont-size : 11pt;\n\t\t\tcolor : white;\n\t\t}\n\t\t\n\tfieldset.intro {\n\t\tbackground-color: gray;\n\t\tborder-color: green;\n\t\tborder-width: 10px 20px;\n\t\tshadow: 5px;5px;outset;\n\t}\n\t\n\t</style>\n</haed>\n<body>\n<fieldset class=\"intro\">\n\t<legend >\n\t&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;특수문자&amp;연습</br>\n\t</legend>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&lt;총괄과제&gt;<br>\n<hr shadow=\"5px 5px inset\" />\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학&nbsp;&nbsp;과&nbsp;:&nbsp;멀티미디어학과<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;학&nbsp;&nbsp;번&nbsp;:&nbsp;22200614<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;이&nbsp;&nbsp;름&nbsp;:&nbsp;김신욱<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;지도교수&nbsp;&nbsp;:&nbsp;최재규<br>\n&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;제풀일&nbsp;:&nbsp;2023-04-03<br>\n</fieldset>\n\t<form acton=\"get\">\n\t\t<header align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<h2>특수문자를 사용하여 페이지를 작성해 보았습니다.</h2>\n\t\t</header>\n\t\t\n\t\t<section>\n\t\t\t<font color=\"red\"><strong>&num;특수문자를&nbsp;사용해서&nbsp;작성된&nbsp;문장. </strong></font><br><br>\n\t\t\t<div>\n\t\t\t\t<article>\n\t\t\t\t\t<fieldset>\n\t\t\t\t\t<pre class=\"prob\" align=\"center\">\nQ1. 옳은 것을 고르시오. (퀴즈 문제)\na.웹페이지의 수 > 게시글의 글자수\nb.웹페이지의 수 < 게시글의 수\nc.닶이 없다.\n\t\t\t\t\t</pre></fieldset>\n\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" name=\"solve\">a</input>\n\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" name=\"solve\">b</input>\n\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"radio\" name=\"solve\" checked>c</input>\n\t\t\t\t\t<input type=\"button\" value=\"다음\"></input>\n\t\t\t\t</article>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t</section>\n\t\t<hr size=5></hr>\n\t\t<footer align=\"center\">\n\t\t\t<small>\n\t\t\t&copy;KIM SHIN WOOK <br>\n\t\t\t&reg;2023-03-30\n\t\t\t</small>\n\t\t</footer>\n\t</form>\n</body>\n</html>"}